1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:03,168
Nasi putih pernah bikin
ayam lumpuh di Jakarta...

2
00:00:03,168 --> 00:00:04,819
dan berujung Hadiah Nobel!

3
00:00:04,819 --> 00:00:05,811
Di Batavia,

4
00:00:05,811 --> 00:00:09,561
dokter Belanda Christiaan Eijkman
memburu kuman penyebab beri-beri.

5
00:00:09,561 --> 00:00:12,233
Tiba-tiba ayam-ayam labnya lumpuh...

6
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:13,359
lalu sembuh sendiri!

7
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:14,389
Rahasianya?

8
00:00:14,389 --> 00:00:17,824
Juru masak baru menolak memberi
nasi tentara untuk ayam.

9
00:00:17,824 --> 00:00:20,076
Makanannya diganti beras kasar...

10
00:00:20,076 --> 00:00:22,567
yang kulit arinya menyimpan vitamin B1.

11
00:00:22,567 --> 00:00:24,905
Tahun 1929,

12
00:00:24,905 --> 00:00:26,842
Eijkman meraih Hadiah Nobel.

13
00:00:26,842 --> 00:00:29,975
Kamu tim nasi putih atau nasi merah?
